OL,3,GNEWSAParents say toddler found in
OL,4,Amiddle of main road after wandering off
OL,5,Afrom nursery
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeren Fach Day Nursery said it had
OL,8,Fimplemented additional safety measures
OL,9,Fand "the safety, welfare and
OL,10,Fprotection" of every child in their
OL,11,Fcare remained a priority.
